# Visit every screen the engine implements today (CP2 evidence route).
#   WAIT WAIT   let both presentation screens finish their holds (asm/0688)
#   X           not a choice: asm/03A6 redraws the title
#   D           demonstration: the whole poem, asm/03AC
#   WAIT x6     one per couplet, so all six are drawn
#   ESC         ends the demo cycle and returns to the title
#   P           play branch (asm/0764): reads the player record; with no
#               character on the disk it prints (INSERT PLAYER DISK) and waits
#               for ESC, which is exactly what the original does
#   ESC         dismisses that prompt
#   C           create branch (asm/5400). The form is stepped and dropdowned,
#               not typed: 0xf3 is Right (+1) and 0xf1 is Down, so five Rights
#               and a Down takes each stat from its floor of 10 to 15 and moves
#               on, which spends the 30 spare points exactly. Then three pairs
#               of Enter open a dropdown and commit its first row: MALE, HUMAN,
#               FIGHTER. Then a name, Enter to leave the field, Enter on SAVE.
#   0x0d        dismiss the status screen creation ends on
